<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were uneven, prices were $0.50 to $1.00 lower. Top $48.75 per cwt.</p>
<p>     US 1-3    230-260 lbs    47.50-48.75</p>
<p>     US 2-3    260-280 lbs    46.50-47.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $44.00.</p>
<p>     US 1-3    350-450 lbs    42.00</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs    44.00</p>
</text>
